cff-version: 1.2.0
title: MIZAN Security — read-only security engine
message: >-
  If you use MIZAN Security in your research or tooling, please cite it
  using this metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - name: MIZAN Security Contributors
    website: https://github.com/tibatechapp-ship-it/MIZAN
version: 0.17.0-dev
date-released: "2026-11-15"
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/tibatechapp-ship-it/MIZAN
abstract: >-
  A read-only, offline security engine that inspects code, secrets,
  dependencies, CI configuration and documentation in a single pass,
  explains findings in plain language, and never executes user code.
  Ships eight scanners, honest exit codes (0/1/2), SARIF 2.1.0 output,
  an evidence portfolio across many repositories, and isolated repair
  verification.
keywords:
  - security
  - static-analysis
  - sarif
  - secrets
  - ci-security
  - supply-chain
